<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><h1 data-lake-id="brYBk" id="brYBk"><span data-lake-id="u2313a355" id="u2313a355">1.一维数组</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="jeweF" id="jeweF"><span data-lake-id="ub834811f" id="ub834811f">1.1 数组概念</span></h2><p data-lake-id="a9a1a0fba8de4acf50cdc8f3e37c6c3a" id="a9a1a0fba8de4acf50cdc8f3e37c6c3a"><span data-lake-id="u6df542ac" id="u6df542ac" class="lake-fontsize-12">数组是含有多个数据值的数据结构，并且每个数据值具有</span><span data-lake-id="u03201bbc" id="u03201bbc" class="lake-fontsize-12">相同的数 据类型</span><span data-lake-id="u1bdcb25f" id="u1bdcb25f" class="lake-fontsize-12">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua61351cc" id="ua61351cc"><span data-lake-id="u916565ab" id="u916565ab" class="lake-fontsize-12">这些数据值称为元素 （element），可以根据元素在数组中 所处的位置把它们一个个地选出来，数组元素是存储到一片连续的内存中的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="bedf9193e776a9bce1b48e3639236f39" id="bedf9193e776a9bce1b48e3639236f39"><span data-lake-id="ud8ce66bb" id="ud8ce66bb" class="lake-fontsize-12">最简单的数组类型就是一维数组，一维数组中的元素一个接一个地编 排在单独一行，这里可以假设 有一个名为a 的一维数组：</span></p><p data-lake-id="e134d85dff86f827661691ef6aa8f44d" id="e134d85dff86f827661691ef6aa8f44d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560112365-a669f729-dcf0-4216-b4a3-e3adff79c976.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A594%2C%22originHeight%22%3A95%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eaeaea%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z1NKO%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="eed44ff1fab34ef75d8c32a85769830d" id="eed44ff1fab34ef75d8c32a85769830d"><span data-lake-id="ua5b81c6b" id="ua5b81c6b" class="lake-fontsize-12">为了声明数组，需要指明数组元素的类型和数量 。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud062b94e" id="ud062b94e"><span data-lake-id="u689a7fed" id="u689a7fed" class="lake-fontsize-12">例如，为了声明 数组a 有10个int 类型的元素，可以写成</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%5B10%5D%3B%5Cn%2F*%5Cn%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%20a%20%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%89%2010%20%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%20int%20%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%5Cnint%20%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E5%8D%A0%204%20%E5%AD%97%E8%8A%82%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E9%82%A3%E4%B9%88%2010%20%E4%B8%AAint%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E5%B0%B1%E5%8D%A0%2040%20%E5%AD%97%E8%8A%82%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%AE%83%E4%BB%AC%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%98%AF%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E7%9A%84%E3%80%82%5Cn*%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uyVic%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="74c575b4371fd9145a27e59fc8d654dd" id="74c575b4371fd9145a27e59fc8d654dd"><span data-lake-id="u5b978f5a" id="u5b978f5a" class="lake-fontsize-12">a 是数组名，即这片连续内存的名称</span></p><p data-lake-id="cd71ba0073293f181e87ddbf3c6142d0" id="cd71ba0073293f181e87ddbf3c6142d0"><span data-lake-id="ua3aedd33" id="ua3aedd33" class="lake-fontsize-12">[10] 代表这片连续内存总共分成10个相等的格子，每个格子称为数组的元素</span></p><p data-lake-id="8ddc4fd08ee2a7a81cc99e5c284259ab" id="8ddc4fd08ee2a7a81cc99e5c284259ab"><span data-lake-id="u40f97b4a" id="u40f97b4a" class="lake-fontsize-12">int 代表每个元素的类型，可以是任意基本类型，也可以是组合类型，甚至可以是数组</span></p><p data-lake-id="u49aeafb8" id="u49aeafb8" style="text-align: left"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22xExm5%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)"></card><span data-lake-id="uca154ec5" id="uca154ec5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">：</span></p><ul list="u7b0d7e01"><li fid="u0cf6fabf" data-lake-id="u25615b21" id="u25615b21" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u53965098" id="u53965098" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">类型说明符 数组名[整型常量表达式];</span></li><li fid="u0cf6fabf" data-lake-id="ub7512ab5" id="ub7512ab5" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u19781593" id="u19781593" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">类型说明符：指定数组元素的数据类型，任意c语言合法类型都可以</span></li><li fid="u0cf6fabf" data-lake-id="uf583b4be" id="uf583b4be" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u848a4c3d" id="u848a4c3d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">数组名 ： c语言标识符，其值为该数组的首地址(常量)</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="J4OhO" id="J4OhO"><span data-lake-id="u64e2bb5d" id="u64e2bb5d">1.2 数组初始化</span></h2><p data-lake-id="b5a04bd5a8706a098fe9471786e1e253" id="b5a04bd5a8706a098fe9471786e1e253"><span data-lake-id="ub43e0762" id="ub43e0762" class="lake-fontsize-12">在定义的时候赋值，称为初始化</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B1%2C%202%2C%203%2C%204%2C%205%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BNXz1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="354a745a1ffb9f695bf7780031301930" id="354a745a1ffb9f695bf7780031301930"><span data-lake-id="ue5d9795d" id="ue5d9795d" class="lake-fontsize-12">通过将数组元素的初值依次放在一对花括号中，如此初始化之后，a[0]=1；a[1]=2；a[2]=3；a[3]=4；a[4]=5，即从左到右依次赋给每个元素。</span></p><p data-lake-id="c0bd4c49fa75c92513cce48389b02ba8" id="c0bd4c49fa75c92513cce48389b02ba8"><span data-lake-id="ue2158877" id="ue2158877" class="lake-fontsize-12">需要注意的是，初始化时各元素间是用逗号隔开的，不是用分号。</span></p><p data-lake-id="4db4421f5f61035adb1ae783e1372d86" id="4db4421f5f61035adb1ae783e1372d86"><span data-lake-id="u6eacbd14" id="u6eacbd14" class="lake-fontsize-12">可以只给一部分元素赋值，这叫“不完全初始化”</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B1%2C%202%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LBHag%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="dec05ef887ed8188796900843225636a" id="dec05ef887ed8188796900843225636a"><span data-lake-id="u74ca483a" id="u74ca483a" class="lake-fontsize-12">定义的数组 a 有 5 个元素，但花括号内只提供两个初值，这表示只给前面两个元素 a[0]、a[1] 初始化，而后面三个元素都没有被初始化。不完全初始化时，没有被初始化的元素自动为 0。</span></p><p data-lake-id="9c350e44c282b0d503d9dc248a323adc" id="9c350e44c282b0d503d9dc248a323adc"><span data-lake-id="u5905dfde" id="u5905dfde" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><ul list="u16d64c0c" class="lake-list"><li fid="u9463062c" version="1735716200438" data-lake-id="u7077c463" id="u7077c463" class="lake-list-node lake-list-task"><card type="inline" name="checkbox" value="data:true"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3ed4b92" id="ua3ed4b92" class="lake-fontsize-12">需要注意的是，“不完全初始化”和“完全不初始化”不一样。如果“完全不初始化”，即只定义“int a[5]；”而不初始化，那么各个元素的值就不是0了，所有元素都是垃圾值。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="9e53b4dbce9222f3ea0ef290d406bedf" id="9e53b4dbce9222f3ea0ef290d406bedf"><span data-lake-id="u14be9f26" id="u14be9f26" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="d347522c5b281177336315169d722119" id="d347522c5b281177336315169d722119"><span data-lake-id="u1e6dd5ad" id="u1e6dd5ad" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果定义数组时就给数组中所有元素赋初值，那么就可以不指定数组的长度，因为此时元素的个数已经确定了，系统会自动分配空间</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%5B%5D%20%3D%20%7B1%2C%202%2C%203%2C%204%2C%205%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MRhCA%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="16c8b043fbf05b72e68f63ce36cb3afc" id="16c8b043fbf05b72e68f63ce36cb3afc"><span data-lake-id="u9a957c53" id="u9a957c53" class="lake-fontsize-12">元素下标：数组开头位置的偏移量，下标从 0 开始，即从 a[0] 开始，而不是 a[1]</span></p><p data-lake-id="1ecd7b420d832a40e8a751e599f30848" id="1ecd7b420d832a40e8a751e599f30848"><span data-lake-id="u603f7cda" id="u603f7cda" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="ede7ad14bc26bdb92d1a0aef10e74aea" id="ede7ad14bc26bdb92d1a0aef10e74aea" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560112524-778cf567-5741-465b-8d23-d12235e00d96.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A355%2C%22originHeight%22%3A122%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eaeaea%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vyFWz%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="8a5c27b5d59af9dbb960d4cdd906df25" id="8a5c27b5d59af9dbb960d4cdd906df25" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ue2dc9d62" id="ue2dc9d62" class="lake-fontsize-12">元素下标偏移量</span></p><p data-lake-id="ddeec9aa6815de7e342850cf65b2ab3c" id="ddeec9aa6815de7e342850cf65b2ab3c"><span data-lake-id="ue10284da" id="ue10284da" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B1%2C%202%2C%203%2C%204%2C%205%7D%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20(i%3D0%3B%20i%3C5%3B%20i%2B%2B)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20a%5Bi%5D)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FpRZl%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="9710896e9222bab89778b221b024ee9b" id="9710896e9222bab89778b221b024ee9b"><span data-lake-id="u5004971a" id="u5004971a" class="lake-fontsize-12">demo：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%5Cnint%20a%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B100%2C200%2C300%2C400%2C500%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cnint%20a%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B100%2C200%2C300%2C400%2C500%2C600%7D%3B%20%5Cnint%20a%5B%20%5D%20%3D%20%7B100%2C200%2C300%7D%3B%5Cnint%20a%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B100%2C200%2C300%7D%3B%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PLP5m%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="089ab6162a09009ffda634bceb064329" id="089ab6162a09009ffda634bceb064329"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735716986387-3d714bbe-f82d-4c45-8f13-96ae7defe13d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc420adea-ea3e-4d95-8e8c-b7f74471103%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ufa6f3dc6-4d0b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A356%2C%22height%22%3A140%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A25078%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A712%2C%22originHeight%22%3A280%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22300%20400%20100%20200%20500%20%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A313%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A30%2C%22text%22%3A%22300%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A424%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A28%2C%22text%22%3A%22400%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A87%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A29%2C%22text%22%3A%22100%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A200%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A29%2C%22text%22%3A%22200%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A538%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A27%2C%22text%22%3A%22500%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A145%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A270%2C%22height%22%3A39%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1f1e4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc7f661fb%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="6344bbfedfa43737c7b7cfa09af8bae0" id="6344bbfedfa43737c7b7cfa09af8bae0"><span data-lake-id="u85150595" id="u85150595" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="bJX5Y" id="bJX5Y"><span data-lake-id="uc9aa6e65" id="uc9aa6e65">1.3 数组元素引用</span></h2><p data-lake-id="30240c0702b9d4560b69c774ea6af2dd" id="30240c0702b9d4560b69c774ea6af2dd"><span data-lake-id="u97309e8a" id="u97309e8a" class="lake-fontsize-12">数组名[下标]：</span></p><ul list="uc8cbd9bd"><li fid="uf59fd743" data-lake-id="uefdced6a" id="uefdced6a"><span data-lake-id="u36beb7eb" id="u36beb7eb" class="lake-fontsize-12">&quot;下标&quot;：C语言的下标是从0开始，下标必须是&gt;=0的整数</span></li><li fid="uf59fd743" data-lake-id="uec4ffa68" id="uec4ffa68"><span data-lake-id="ue67b82c9" id="ue67b82c9" class="lake-fontsize-12">a[0]、a[1]、a[n]</span></li><li fid="uf59fd743" data-lake-id="u83384ecc" id="u83384ecc"><span data-lake-id="ub0886a2d" id="ub0886a2d" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></li><li fid="uf59fd743" data-lake-id="uc5ddbded" id="uc5ddbded"><span data-lake-id="uf1749bf4" id="uf1749bf4" class="lake-fontsize-12">引用数组元素a[i]和普通变量一样，既可以作为左值，也可以作为右值</span></li><li fid="uf59fd743" data-lake-id="u91737f37" id="u91737f37"><span data-lake-id="ub2039810" id="ub2039810" class="lake-fontsize-12">下标最小值为0,最大值为 元素个数 -1</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2Fdemo%5Cnint%20a%5B5%5D%3B%20%5Cna%5B0%5D%20%3D%201%3B%5Cna%5B1%5D%20%3D%2066%3B%5Cna%5B2%5D%20%3D%2021%3B%5Cna%5B3%5D%20%3D%204%3B%5Cna%5B4%5D%20%3D%20934%3B%5Cn%5Cna%5B5%5D%20%3D%2062%3B%20%5Cna%20%20%20%20%3D%2010%3B%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zjDsH%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="fd5e414b05de214c573c3ac4fac580fa" id="fd5e414b05de214c573c3ac4fac580fa"><span data-lake-id="u0881f466" id="u0881f466" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：定义数组时用到的“数组名[常量表达式]”和引用数组元素时用到的“数组名[下标]”是有区别的，定义数组时的常量表达式表示的是数组的长度，而引用数组元素时的下标表示的是元素的编号</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B1%2C%202%2C%203%2C%204%2C%205%7D%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%BA5%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84a%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20t%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20t%20%3D%20a%5B3%5D%3B%20%20%2F*%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84a%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%8B%E6%A0%87%E4%B8%BA3%E7%9A%84%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0a%5B3%5D%2C%20%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%843%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%9A%84%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22t%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20t)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%20%20%20%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BKCBW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="8354101627614cb807a3903802fba98c" id="8354101627614cb807a3903802fba98c"><span data-lake-id="u20993381" id="u20993381" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u9621b2cf" id="u9621b2cf"><span data-lake-id="u784263ca" id="u784263ca" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="uf152f95e" id="uf152f95e"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22KoTsw%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2172fa5" id="ub2172fa5" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9ad71b40" id="u9ad71b40"><span data-lake-id="ubdadc9b9" id="ubdadc9b9" class="lake-fontsize-12">测量数组的总大小（字节）:sizeof(array)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ueba0b767" id="ueba0b767"><span data-lake-id="ufea07fab" id="ufea07fab" class="lake-fontsize-12">测量数组元素个数：sizeof(array)/sizeof(array[0])</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%BB%8E%E8%80%8C%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20Array%5B%5D%20%3D%20%7B10%2C20%7D%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Csizeof(Array))%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%9A%84%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20count%20%3D%20sizeof(Array)%20%2F%20sizeof(Array%5B0%5D)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%3A%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ccount)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%2