6ba3" id="ue56a6ba3">2.字符数组</span></h1><p data-lake-id="1f7ff71006d12fedae0a7a17788dd6f5" id="1f7ff71006d12fedae0a7a17788dd6f5"><span data-lake-id="uc301ceeb" id="uc301ceeb" class="lake-fontsize-12">用来存放字符的数组称为字符数组</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20a%5B10%5D%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%B4%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%5Cnchar%20c%5B20%5D%3D%7B'c'%2C%20'%20%20'%2C%20'p'%2C%20'r'%2C%20'o'%2C%20'g'%2C%20'r'%2C%20'a'%2C'm'%7D%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%5Cnchar%20d%5B%5D%3D%7B'c'%2C%20'%20'%2C%20'p'%2C%20'r'%2C%20'o'%2C%20'g'%2C%20'r'%2C%20'a'%2C%20'm'%20%7D%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%85%A8%E4%BD%93%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E6%97%B6%E5%8F%AF%E7%9C%81%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__height%22%3A111.3046875%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rczmL%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22height%22%3A111.3046875%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20s1%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B'a'%2C%20'b'%2C%20'c'%2C%20'd'%2C%20'e'%7D%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20s1%E5%AD%98%E6%94%BE%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%5Cnchar%20s2%5B6%5D%20%3D%20%7B'a'%2C%20'b'%2C%20'c'%2C%20'd'%2C%20'e'%2C%20'%5C%5C0'%7D%3B%20%2F%2F%20s2%E5%AD%98%E6%94%BE%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%5Cnchar%20s%5B6%5D%20%3D%20%7B%5C%22abcde%5C%22%7D%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%5Cnchar%20s%5B6%5D%20%3D%20%20%5C%22abcde%5C%22%20%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A4%A7%E6%8B%AC%E5%8F%B7%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%5Cn%5Cns%5B0%5D%20%3D%20'A'%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%BA%20'A'%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%A0%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%5Cnchar%20str%5B%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22www.baidu.com%5C%22%3B%20%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y3eAI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="2b7ea4c333b1475d831178b9f316245a" id="2b7ea4c333b1475d831178b9f316245a"><span data-lake-id="u11d896df" id="u11d896df" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符数组实际上是一系列字符的集合，也就是字符串（String）</span></p><p data-lake-id="d9cf39470daf2b9a628135cd44fd872e" id="d9cf39470daf2b9a628135cd44fd872e"><span data-lake-id="u6b4681d7" id="u6b4681d7" class="lake-fontsize-12">在C语言中，没有专门的字符串变量，没有string类型，通常就用一个字符数组来存放一个字符串。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ba295a4507f30082dfbcd377a55394e3" id="ba295a4507f30082dfbcd377a55394e3"><span data-lake-id="u20c408a3" id="u20c408a3" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符串是一系列连续的字符的组合，要想在内存中定位一个字符串，除了要知道它的开头，还要知道它的结尾。找到字符串的开头很容易，知道它的名字（字符数组名或者字符串名）就可以；然而，如何找到字符串的结尾呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id="6aa798b8a70eef5e0f6d027d336b6eb0" id="6aa798b8a70eef5e0f6d027d336b6eb0"><span data-lake-id="u295dfecc" id="u295dfecc" class="lake-fontsize-12">在C语言中，字符串总是以'\0'作为结尾，所以'\0'也被称为字符串结束标志，或者字符串结束符。</span></p><ul list="u1ff635f2"><li fid="u30f3f648" data-lake-id="ubc9e3608" id="ubc9e3608"><span data-lake-id="u36864476" id="u36864476" class="lake-fontsize-12">'\0'是 ASCII 码表中的第 0 个字符，该字符既不能显示，也没有控制功能，输出该字符不会有任何效果，它在C语言中唯一的作用就是作为字符串结束标志。</span></li><li fid="u30f3f648" data-lake-id="u867bf373" id="u867bf373"><span data-lake-id="u4021177a" id="u4021177a" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言在处理字符串时，会从前往后逐个扫描字符，一旦遇到'\0'就认为到达了字符串的末尾，就结束处理。'\0'至关重要，没有'\0'就意味着永远也到达不了字符串的结尾</span></li><li fid="u30f3f648" data-lake-id="u7add50fc" id="u7add50fc"><span data-lake-id="u9d52166f" id="u9d52166f" class="lake-fontsize-12">由&quot; &quot;包围的字符串会自动在末尾添加'\0'。例如，&quot;abc123&quot;从表面看起来只包含了 6 个字符，其实不然，C语言会在最后隐式地添加一个'\0'，这个过程是在后台默默地进行的，所以我们感受不到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="3dc1631fd0af54cc6c6633ee1da289f6" id="3dc1631fd0af54cc6c6633ee1da289f6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560113448-d14b06f6-b364-41a8-b2dd-3633fa8ff93d.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A277%2C%22originHeight%22%3A49%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d7d7d7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pupz4%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="91fb98aa571ecdb185a42082a3d03ee4" id="91fb98aa571ecdb185a42082a3d03ee4" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0922236b" id="u0922236b" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符串常量在内存中的存放位置</span></p><p data-lake-id="8119fc8ab5576769b83516e1a1a64edc" id="8119fc8ab5576769b83516e1a1a64edc"><span data-lake-id="uf9ddc592" id="uf9ddc592" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><ul list="ud2b72baa"><li fid="u5b150dff" data-lake-id="ue717d8fe" id="ue717d8fe"><span data-lake-id="uc78d0e61" id="uc78d0e61" class="lake-fontsize-12">当用字符数组存储字符串时，要特别注意'\0'，要为'\0'留个位置；这意味着，字符数组的长度至少要比字符串的长度大 1</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20str%5B7%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22abc123%5C%22%3B%5Cn%2F*%5Cn%5C%22abc123%5C%22%E7%9C%8B%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%E5%8F%AA%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E4%BA%86%206%20%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%8D%B4%E5%B0%86%20str%20%E7%9A%84%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%BA%207%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E8%83%BD%E5%A4%9F%E5%AE%B9%E7%BA%B3%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%5Cn'%5C%5C0'%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E5%B0%86%20str%20%E7%9A%84%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%BA%206%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%83%E5%B0%B1%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%B9%E7%BA%B3'%5C%5C0'%E4%BA%86%E3%80%82%5Cn*%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i4OOd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="2c9a7c18b4c5bd6fea39c49434f58412" id="2c9a7c18b4c5bd6fea39c49434f58412"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="DKqf8" id="DKqf8"><span data-lake-id="udf23d050" id="udf23d050">3.变长数组</span></h1><p data-lake-id="7486e9d8d0c6b22f05ee00b2598a2b04" id="7486e9d8d0c6b22f05ee00b2598a2b04"><span data-lake-id="ub0fd532a" id="ub0fd532a" class="lake-fontsize-12">数组变量的长度必须用常量表达式进行定义。但是在 C99中，有时候也可以使用非常量表达式。</span></p><p data-lake-id="707412b784471ed194ef9c925698d168" id="707412b784471ed194ef9c925698d168"><span data-lake-id="ue5217317" id="ue5217317" class="lake-fontsize-12">定义时，使用变量作为元素个数的数组。</span></p><p data-lake-id="9ce747496629b3b22e26732a02477a3d" id="9ce747496629b3b22e26732a02477a3d"><span data-lake-id="uce4721f9" id="uce4721f9" class="lake-fontsize-12">变长数组仅仅指元素个数在定义时是变量，而绝非指数组的长度可长可短。实际上，不管是普通数组还是所谓的变长数组，数组一旦定义完毕，其长度则不可改变。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20size%20%3D%203%3B%5Cnint%20a%5Bsize%5D%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%5Cna%5B0%5D%20%3D%2010%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x5Fdx%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="2476de99affe2e80272dd8c4df8d6645" id="2476de99affe2e80272dd8c4df8d6645"><span data-lake-id="u198fc590" id="u198fc590" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意:变长数组不可初始化，即以下代码是错误的：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20len%20%3D%205%3B%5Cnint%20a%5Blen%5D%20%3D%20%7B1%2C2%2C3%2C4%2C5%7D%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%20a%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g70Hw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u81fcfc33" id="u81fcfc33"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A01%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A4%2C%22id%22%3A%22AVKON%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u11b47539" id="u11b47539" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3cb23b66" id="u3cb23b66"><span data-lake-id="u21ab66a7" id="u21ab66a7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">定义一个char str[6] = {'h','e','l','l','o'}; //把这个数组的内存图画出来，并且把数组的名字的地址，还有每个元素的地址都打印出来，每个元素的地址相差几个字节？</span></p><p data-lake-id="u71711443" id="u71711443"><span data-lake-id="u564a20f7" id="u564a20f7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="ua483c71a" id="ua483c71a"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E8%A7%A3%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A5%2C%22id%22%3A%22EG066%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)"></card><span data-lake-id="u90ef3eb2" id="u90ef3eb2" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u25e92721" id="u25e92721"><span data-lake-id="uf5185533" id="uf5185533" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">通过对数组元素地址解引用，可以获取地址空间里面的数据</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%26a)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20*%20%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E5%B0%86%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E9%87%8C%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E5%8F%96%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%8A%8A%E5%AE%83%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E8%A7%A3%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C*(%26a))%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F--------------------------%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20Array%5B5%5D%20%3D%20%7B'j'%2C'a'%2C'c'%2C'k'%7D%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25c%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2CArray%5B0%5D)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25c%2C%25c%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C*(Array%2B0)%2C*(%26Array%5B0%5D))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25c%2C%25c%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C*(Array%2B1)%2C*(%26Array%5B1%5D))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25c%2C%25c%5C%5Cn%5C%22